WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.111
A frame describes which rows within an ordered
partition contribute to the current calculation For

00:00:07.125 --> 00:00:10.940
a running total the frame may start at the beginning
and end at the current

00:00:10.967 --> 00:00:16.736
row For a three-row moving average it may include
two preceding rows

00:00:16.763 --> 00:00:22.631
and the current row For some value functions the
frame may need to extend

00:00:22.658 --> 00:00:24.079
to the end of the partition
